# wrangler's local state (`wrangler pages dev`, login cache)
.wrangler/

# build-og.mjs writes the page it screenshots under .cache/og-render/ (not under
# public/, because `public/` is copied verbatim into `dist/`). The cards themselves
# are committed binaries: a count painted into a PNG is not diffable, so
# src/data/og.json records what they were drawn from.
